  "description": "另一个读者看到我最近关于飞机尾迹的微博，给我来信说：",
  "body_html": "<p>另一个读者看到我最近关于飞机尾迹的微博，给我来信说：</p><p>-------</p><p>王老师：</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 你好，看过您写的很多博客文章，学到很多知识，感谢。</p><p>今天偶然看到华尔街日报的一个新闻视频，一架战机飞行时没有尾迹，但撒油时，出现了尾迹。</p><p>视频链接：www.wsj.com/video/china/B7CFC93D-373F-4825-8511-0F3AA3C28754.html</p><p>-------</p><p>我看了一下这个视频，虽然我认为飞机洒油的时候确实会出现明显的尾迹，但我提醒他，这个视频是假的，完全是电脑动画（图 1，2）。</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!bc1d!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F872219ec-c7ee-486c-bade-7545cbd2b73c_640x437.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!bc1d!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F872219ec-c7ee-486c-bade-7545cbd2b73c_640x437.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!bc1d!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F872219ec-c7ee-486c-bade-7545cbd2b73c_640x437.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!bc1d!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F872219ec-c7ee-486c-bade-7545cbd2b73c_640x437.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!bc1d!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F872219ec-c7ee-486c-bade-7545cbd2b73c_640x437.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!bc1d!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F872219ec-c7ee-486c-bade-7545cbd2b73c_640x437.jpeg\" width=\"640\" height=\"437